{"4913000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Concrete Carnage: Scrapheap", "steam_appid": 4913000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/6642fd5bbed6eb9920524915cbef2c93.avif?t=1784394086\" width=348 height=420 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRUMPLED METAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Concrete Carnage: Scrapheap</strong> puts you back in the DNA of brutal 90s racing games, where crumpled metal was worth as much as the finish line. No weapons, no missiles, no easy shortcuts. Just you and your truck against everything else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/15c7000bed877f3a781720cef1f3e972.poster.avif?t=1784394086\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/15c7000bed877f3a781720cef1f3e972.webm?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/15c7000bed877f3a781720cef1f3e972.mp4?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every impact is felt. The bodywork deforms, parts fly off, the engine takes the hit. Surviving a race is already a victory. Winning one is another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARNAGE BY THE NUMBERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/c016cd32a1ad1218f128d06f5100ab31.avif?t=1784394086\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your rivals in <strong>Arena Combat</strong> or keep your nerve in <strong>Fatal Freight</strong>: an explosive cargo, a ruthless course, and every hit could be your last. Six game modes, from classic racing to pure carnage, with precision driving in between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every credit counts. Repair your truck mid-race, haul bonus cargo, upgrade your vehicle between events. Destruction pays, if you survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game modes*: from pure destruction to surgical precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable trucks* with distinct profiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 semi-open maps* to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time visual bodywork deformation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive damage and repair system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: engine, suspension, tires</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups: Nitro, Shield, Heal, Magnet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush pedestrians to clear your path and earn credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul cargo to maximize your credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetic inspired by 90s games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*figures subject to change until the final release.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/44445186dfc2b6c5a1f1ccec2f56ee08.poster.avif?t=1784394086\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/44445186dfc2b6c5a1f1ccec2f56ee08.webm?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/44445186dfc2b6c5a1f1ccec2f56ee08.mp4?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HEXAGON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hexagon was meant to be the garden of humanity. Thanks to Celestial Matter, extracted from a forgotten meteorite, the country sacrificed its landscapes for Total Agriculture. But the dream turned into a chemical nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Surcharge swept everything away. A viscous soup of cyanobacteria, fluorescent and lethal, now blankets the plains. The Hexagon is nothing more than an architecture of emptiness surrounded by The Furrow, a toxic expanse where biology defies all reason. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruins, men set out in their trucks to recover fragments of the original matter. They are known as The Gleaners.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/6642fd5bbed6eb9920524915cbef2c93.avif?t=1784394086\" width=348 height=420 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRUMPLED METAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Concrete Carnage: Scrapheap</strong> puts you back in the DNA of brutal 90s racing games, where crumpled metal was worth as much as the finish line. No weapons, no missiles, no easy shortcuts. Just you and your truck against everything else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/15c7000bed877f3a781720cef1f3e972.poster.avif?t=1784394086\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/15c7000bed877f3a781720cef1f3e972.webm?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/15c7000bed877f3a781720cef1f3e972.mp4?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every impact is felt. The bodywork deforms, parts fly off, the engine takes the hit. Surviving a race is already a victory. Winning one is another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARNAGE BY THE NUMBERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/c016cd32a1ad1218f128d06f5100ab31.avif?t=1784394086\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your rivals in <strong>Arena Combat</strong> or keep your nerve in <strong>Fatal Freight</strong>: an explosive cargo, a ruthless course, and every hit could be your last. Six game modes, from classic racing to pure carnage, with precision driving in between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every credit counts. Repair your truck mid-race, haul bonus cargo, upgrade your vehicle between events. Destruction pays, if you survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game modes*: from pure destruction to surgical precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable trucks* with distinct profiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 semi-open maps* to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time visual bodywork deformation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive damage and repair system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: engine, suspension, tires</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups: Nitro, Shield, Heal, Magnet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush pedestrians to clear your path and earn credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul cargo to maximize your credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetic inspired by 90s games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*figures subject to change until the final release.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/44445186dfc2b6c5a1f1ccec2f56ee08.poster.avif?t=1784394086\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/44445186dfc2b6c5a1f1ccec2f56ee08.webm?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4913000/extras/44445186dfc2b6c5a1f1ccec2f56ee08.mp4?t=1784394086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HEXAGON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hexagon was meant to be the garden of humanity. Thanks to Celestial Matter, extracted from a forgotten meteorite, the country sacrificed its landscapes for Total Agriculture. But the dream turned into a chemical nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Surcharge swept everything away. A viscous soup of cyanobacteria, fluorescent and lethal, now blankets the plains. The Hexagon is nothing more than an architecture of emptiness surrounded by The Furrow, a toxic expanse where biology defies all reason. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ruins, men set out in their trucks to recover fragments of the original matter. They are known as The Gleaners.</p>", "short_description": "Drive trucks through a post-apocalyptic giscardpunk world. Crush pedestrians, destroy your rivals, haul cargo. No weapons — just tons of steel. The brutality of 90s games, no compromise.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, 